ke that, already at the doors before you’re fully awake, sounds exhausting and unsettling. What goes through your mind in those first moments when you find yourself there?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4374,"promptTokens":456,"completionTokens":92,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 15:52:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"5f78e8a5de454dd0bfae7b7a58d1a9bb","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.3050507941185517E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f0c86438f403db4d1423","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795420360949,"createTime":"2026-11-23 15:52:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f0c86438f403db4d1423","chatId":"645a89560b4c49d2a751b2b9bd95be54","sessionId":null,"userId":130557,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"The nights. I wake at four o'clock most mornings and I am up and at the doors before I know I have moved.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":6,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"5f78e8a5de454dd0bfae7b7a58d1a9bb","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.3050507941185517E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"rel